[statement]
Which provider answers a name provided at no version depends on the order a
package lists its dependencies in. Here `b` lists `y` first: `y` has one
provider, `p2`, which also provides `x`, and `x` is then met by `p2` alone,
though `p1` ranks higher for it.

[repository]
P:b
V:1.0-r0
D:y x

P:p1
V:1.0-r0
p:x
k:100

P:p2
V:1.0-r0
p:x y=1
k:10

[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p2 1.0-r0
install b 1.0-r0
